5877
05:50:35,160 --> 05:50:40,840
NDA Administrator Marcus Antonius T. Andaya: for our children? Tama po, Mr. Chair. One of the reasons po bakit hindi dumadami ang ating

5878
05:50:40,840 --> 05:50:45,880
NDA Administrator Marcus Antonius T. Andaya: milk production is napakakonti po ng ating mga alagang gatasang hayop. Dahil po sa mahabang

5879
