NDA Administrator Marcus Antonius T. Andaya: Mr. Chair, actually, pagdating po sa milk feeding program, wala na po kami talaga ang maireklamo dahil napakagandang budget ang naibigay po sa National Dairy Authority para sa milk feeding program.

5903
05:53:02,060 --> 05:53:08,780
NDA Administrator Marcus Antonius T. Andaya: Noong mga nakaraang panahon po kasi, ang problema ng ating mga magagatas, tumutulo po ang gatas, walang bumibili, literally tinatapon.

5904
05:53:09,380 --> 05:53:14,980
NDA Administrator Marcus Antonius T. Andaya: But because of this milk feeding program, naingganyo po sila na alagaan ng hayop nila magpagatas.

5905
05:53:14,980 --> 05:53:19,860
NDA Administrator Marcus Antonius T. Andaya: And that's one of the reasons why nag-increase ang milk production, dahil pinagahanda nila ang milk feeding program.

5906
05:53:20,160 --> 05:53:24,800
NDA Administrator Marcus Antonius T. Andaya: Now, pagdating naman po sa budget ng NDA, may iiyak po kayo sa neb na naibigay sa amin.

5907
05:53:26,320 --> 05:53:30,300
NDA Administrator Marcus Antonius T. Andaya: Nasa P216 lang po. Taman-tama lang po yung pang-sweldo. Actually, kulang pa po.

5908
05:53:31,000 --> 05:53:36,740
NDA Administrator Marcus Antonius T. Andaya: Kaya po, napakasakitignan na ang mga kawani po ng NDA, sumusweldo pero walang gagawin.

5909
05:53:37,940 --> 05:53:45,420
Rep. Cielo Krisel Lagman: Yung P3 billion na budget para sa milk feeding program ay direct ang mapupunta sa mga farmers at sa mga cooperatives, hindi po ba?

5910
05:53:45,760 --> 05:53:46,020
Rep. Cielo Krisel Lagman: Yes, po.

5911
05:53:46,020 --> 05:53:47,580
Rep. Cielo Krisel Lagman: At hindi naman talaga sa NDA.

5912
05:53:48,140 --> 05:53:50,140
NDA Administrator Marcus Antonius T. Andaya: Yan po yung pera po ng debit for milk feeding program.

5913
05:53:50,160 --> 05:53:56,860
NDA Administrator Marcus Antonius T. Andaya: Yung pera po ng debit for milk feeding program ay binigay po sa NDA at sa PCC upang ipamili namin ng gatas sa ating mga dairy farmers gamit ang sagipsaka.

5914
05:53:57,760 --> 05:54:05,860
NDA Administrator Marcus Antonius T. Andaya: Kaya mas madali po natin may bibigay ang ating servisyo o ating mabibiling gatas sa mga farmers dahil diretsyo po natin ipoprofure sa kanila yan.

5915
05:54:05,980 --> 05:54:07,660
NDA Administrator Marcus Antonius T. Andaya: Hindi na po sila magpapatayan sa presyo.

5916
05:54:09,440 --> 05:54:12,720
Rep. Cielo Krisel Lagman: Okay, so tingnan mo yung sitwasyon ng NDA.

5917
05:54:13,000 --> 05:54:17,000
Rep. Cielo Krisel Lagman: Huwag mo masyadong, talagang kulang na kulang talaga sila sa pod.

5918
05:54:17,000 --> 05:54:20,140
Rep. Cielo Krisel Lagman: Yan, yan ang maganda, Chris Van Rufus.

5919
05:54:20,160 --> 05:54:21,820
Rep. Cielo Krisel Lagman: Is my time over?

5920
05:54:22,260 --> 05:54:22,640
Rep. Jose "Bong" J. Teves Jr.: Not yet.

5921
05:54:22,720 --> 05:54:23,580
Rep. Cielo Krisel Lagman: Not yet, okay.

5922
05:54:24,180 --> 05:54:25,580
Rep. Cielo Krisel Lagman: Salamat po, attorney.

5923
05:54:25,820 --> 05:54:26,640
Rep. Cielo Krisel Lagman: Thank you so much.

5924
05:54:26,640 --> 05:54:26,820
Rep. Cielo Krisel Lagman: Maraming salamat po, sir.

5925
05:54:27,260 --> 05:54:33,040
Rep. Cielo Krisel Lagman: Baka kausapin ko na lang po kayo in private yung National, yung Carabao Center.

5926
05:54:33,620 --> 05:54:39,400
Rep. Cielo Krisel Lagman: May mahalaga lang po akong gustong itanong sa Sugar Regulatory Administration.

5927
05:54:41,480 --> 05:54:42,080
SRA Administrator Pablo Luis S. Azcona: Hello.

5928
05:54:43,620 --> 05:54:44,860
Rep. Cielo Krisel Lagman: Good afternoon, sir.

5929
05:54:47,300 --> 05:54:49,860
Rep. Cielo Krisel Lagman: Ngayon, pinag-uusapan natin ang impact ng training.

5930
05:54:50,160 --> 05:54:53,400
Rep. Cielo Krisel Lagman: Sa sweetened beverages.

5931
05:54:55,020 --> 05:55:01,980
Rep. Cielo Krisel Lagman: Nag-impose tayo ng 2018 ng 6 pesos sa refined sugar na ba ito?

5932
05:55:02,540 --> 05:55:02,980
Rep. Cielo Krisel Lagman: Sugar.

5933
05:55:03,000 --> 05:55:03,580
Rep. Cielo Krisel Lagman: Raw sugar.

5934
05:55:03,720 --> 05:55:04,260
Rep. Cielo Krisel Lagman: Raw sugar.

5935
05:55:05,200 --> 05:55:08,980
Rep. Cielo Krisel Lagman: And sa fructose naman ay mas mataas.

5936
05:55:09,480 --> 05:55:12,340
Rep. Cielo Krisel Lagman: And palagay ko mas gamay po ninyo yan, sir.

5937
05:55:13,480 --> 05:55:15,840
Rep. Cielo Krisel Lagman: Gusto namin makuha sana ang trend.

5938
05:55:15,840 --> 05:55:19,060
Rep. Cielo Krisel Lagman: Since 2017 up to the present.

5939
05:55:19,500 --> 05:55:20,140
Rep. Cielo Krisel Lagman: Yung volume.

5940
05:55:20,160 --> 05:55:24,760
Rep. Cielo Krisel Lagman: Volume of sugar consumed and bought by type of industry.

5941
05:55:25,260 --> 05:55:29,420
Rep. Cielo Krisel Lagman: Hindi lang limited sa mga sugar beverages na industry.

5942
05:55:30,940 --> 05:55:35,600
Rep. Cielo Krisel Lagman: And isabay na po rin ninyo yung demand for artificial sweetener.

5943
05:55:36,160 --> 05:55:40,340
Rep. Cielo Krisel Lagman: Kasi I think next week, napag-uusapan po sa Ways and Means Committee,

5944
05:55:40,940 --> 05:55:48,400
Rep. Cielo Krisel Lagman: yung proposal ng Department of Finance na dagdagan ang buwis para sa sweetened beverages.

5945
05:55:48,400 --> 05:55:48,760
Rep. Cielo Krisel Lagman: Yes.

5946
05:55:50,160 --> 05:55:57,580
Rep. Cielo Krisel Lagman: And kailangan po natin makita rin ang impact nitong buwis na ito kung meron man sa ating local sugar farmers.

5947
05:55:58,020 --> 05:56:05,440
Rep. Cielo Krisel Lagman: Kasi naandito si Congresswoman Subiri, I'm quite sure, interesado siya malaman kung anong impact nito sa local farmers natin.

5948
05:56:05,980 --> 05:56:14,120
Rep. Cielo Krisel Lagman: So, kailangan po namin yung data na kung maaari maibigay po sa amin para magkaroon tayo ng trajectory ng sugar trading.

5949
05:56:14,120 --> 05:56:20,120
Rep. Cielo Krisel Lagman: And then anong magiging impact ng dagdag buwis kung meron man sa ating local farmers.

5950
05:56:20,160 --> 05:56:24,160
SRA Administrator Pablo Luis S. Azcona: Yes, po, Mr. Chair, we will provide your office with the data.

5951
05:56:24,160 --> 05:56:28,160
Rep. Jose "Bong" J. Teves Jr.: Okay, thank you, Honorable Lagman.

5952
05:56:28,160 --> 05:56:35,160
Rep. Jose "Bong" J. Teves Jr.: Next, the Chair recognizes Apu Romeo Momos Senor.

5953
05:56:35,160 --> 05:56:39,160
Rep. Romeo S. Momo Sr.: Thank you, Mr. Chairman, Mr. Secretary.

5954
05:56:39,160 --> 05:56:42,160
Rep. Romeo S. Momo Sr.: I will go direct to my parroquial concern, Mr. Secretary.

5955
05:56:42,160 --> 05:56:46,160
Rep. Romeo S. Momo Sr.: I have three questions, one for Philpida, one for BFAR, and one for NIA.

5956
05:56:46,160 --> 05:56:49,160
Rep. Romeo S. Momo Sr.: Mr. Chairman, Mr. Secretary,

5957
05:56:49,160 --> 05:56:57,160
Rep. Romeo S. Momo Sr.: Surigao del Sur, particularly the Municipality of Marihatag, is considered one of the major producers of high-quality abaca fiber.

5958
05:56:57,160 --> 05:57:07,160
Rep. Romeo S. Momo Sr.: In fact, ranked number four among the abaca-producing provinces, producing 4,140 metric tons of abaca fiber in 2025,

5959
05:57:07,160 --> 05:57:18,160
Rep. Romeo S. Momo Sr.: about 7.4% of our national production, and the only abaca-producing province which posted a positive 10% growth rate,

5960
05:57:18,160 --> 05:57:25,160
Rep. Romeo S. Momo Sr.: while the rest of the provinces producing abaca are all in negative growth rate.

5961
05:57:25,160 --> 05:57:36,160
Rep. Romeo S. Momo Sr.: Right now, a road network connecting the production site to the main national highway and market centers are about to be started,

5962
05:57:36,160 --> 05:57:42,160
Rep. Romeo S. Momo Sr.: funded by the PRDP program, the program of the World Bank.

5963
05:57:42,160 --> 05:57:46,160
Rep. Romeo S. Momo Sr.: And Municipality of Marihatag, kahit na maliit ho siya, six plus munis,

5964
05:57:46,160 --> 05:57:55,160
Rep. Romeo S. Momo Sr.: six plus municipality was able to post or to share 30% as a counterpart, which is 30 million po.

5965
05:57:55,160 --> 05:58:00,160
Rep. Romeo S. Momo Sr.: The area being developed is an IP community po, Manubo tribe ho ang nandyan,

5966
05:58:00,160 --> 05:58:05,160
Rep. Romeo S. Momo Sr.: and just recently been declared insurgent-free.

5967
05:58:05,160 --> 05:58:15,160
Rep. Romeo S. Momo Sr.: Dahil yung lugar na yun ho dati ay hindi mapuntahan ng tao dahil talagang insurgent area, rebel infested yun.

5968
05:58:16,160 --> 05:58:20,160
Rep. Romeo S. Momo Sr.: And therefore, most of the farmers are rebel returnees.

5969
05:58:20,160 --> 05:58:24,160
Rep. Romeo S. Momo Sr.: In order to help the Manubo tribe and the rebel returnees,

5970
05:58:24,160 --> 05:58:32,160
Rep. Romeo S. Momo Sr.: thus the establishment of Abaca Agro-Industrial Corridor in the Municipality of Marihatag, Surigao del Sur,

5971
05:58:32,160 --> 05:58:41,160
Rep. Romeo S. Momo Sr.: which was endorsed by RDC as one of the top 30 implementation-ready priority projects in Caraga.

5972
05:58:41,160 --> 05:58:44,160
Rep. Romeo S. Momo Sr.: Kompleto na ho ng papili sito. May feasibility study ang lahat-lahat.

5973
05:58:44,160 --> 05:58:45,160
Rep. Romeo S. Momo Sr.: Kompleto na ho ng papili sito. May feasibility study ang lahat-lahat.

5974
05:58:46,160 --> 05:58:51,160
Rep. Romeo S. Momo Sr.: The total project cost is 739 million.

5975
05:58:51,160 --> 05:58:58,160
Rep. Romeo S. Momo Sr.: But this year ang hiningi lang nila is 47 million lang po para to start with.

5976
05:58:58,160 --> 05:59:05,160
Rep. Romeo S. Momo Sr.: Actually ang 47 million is for the establishment of Abaca Consolidation and Processing Center, if I am right.

5977
05:59:05,160 --> 05:59:11,160
Rep. Romeo S. Momo Sr.: So para lang ho tayo maka-start, para ho mayroon ng bahay kung sa ibig sabihin pa.

5978
05:59:11,160 --> 05:59:14,160
Rep. Romeo S. Momo Sr.: Para tuloy-tuloy na ho ang ating programa.

5979
05:59:14,160 --> 05:59:25,160
Rep. Romeo S. Momo Sr.: Mr. Secretary, wala ng ibang provinces ang may ganun potential in Abaca except Surigao del Sur.

5980
05:59:25,160 --> 05:59:27,160
Rep. Romeo S. Momo Sr.: Kaya nga ho kailangan siguro nating matulungan.

5981
05:59:27,160 --> 05:59:35,160
Rep. Romeo S. Momo Sr.: My question is ang 47 million ba ay naisama natin sa ating budget this year, 2027?

5982
05:59:35,160 --> 05:59:42,160
DA Secretary Francisco P. Tiu Laurel Jr.: Mr. Chair, ang sagot diyan is yes. Kaya lang nasa tier 2, Mr. Chair.

5983
05:59:42,160 --> 05:59:52,160
Rep. Romeo S. Momo Sr.: When you mean tier 2, Secretary, is it not part of your budget, part of the GAO or your NEP right now?

5984
05:59:52,160 --> 06:00:00,240
Rep. Romeo S. Momo Sr.: Because there are tier 1 and tier 2s. I would suppose that's part of...

5985
06:00:01,390 --> 06:00:07,270
DA Secretary Francisco P. Tiu Laurel Jr.: Mr. Chair, ang problem daw, sabi namin USIC for Finance, hindi na-approve yung Tier 2 namin.

5986
06:00:11,100 --> 06:00:16,100
Rep. Romeo S. Momo Sr.: How do we go about it, Mr. Secretary? I think this is one of the best programs TILFIDA ever had.

5987
06:00:16,260 --> 06:00:22,280
DA Secretary Francisco P. Tiu Laurel Jr.: Sige, sir. Meron kaming option. Kailangan lang talaga natin kalagyan ng bahay. May bahay na ba yan?

5988
06:00:23,920 --> 06:00:28,960
DA Secretary Francisco P. Tiu Laurel Jr.: Kailangan lang namin lagyan ng bahay. Meron kaming World Bank na pwedeng i-access, Mr. Chair.

5989
06:00:28,960 --> 06:00:37,020
Rep. Romeo S. Momo Sr.: Actually, the 47 million is just for i-bahay so that the next budget, it will be Tier 1 na. Sana eh.

5990
06:00:38,780 --> 06:00:50,780
DA Secretary Francisco P. Tiu Laurel Jr.: Sige, well, Mr. Chair, we will endeavor na mailagay natin. Tulungan natin, Mr. Chair, na malagay sa budget past Tier 1 kahit lagyan lang ng 5-10 million, then kami nang bahala magdagdag.

5991
06:00:50,780 --> 06:00:58,360
Rep. Romeo S. Momo Sr.: Yes, po. In our side, we'll do also our part. My next question is addressed to BIFAR.

5992
06:01:00,300 --> 06:01:09,000
Rep. Romeo S. Momo Sr.: Of the 13 municipalities and one city in my district, 1st District of Surigao del Sur, 13 of these municipalities are situated along the coast.

5993
06:01:10,120 --> 06:01:16,960
Rep. Romeo S. Momo Sr.: And therefore, 40% of our inhabitants, people in Surigao del Sur, are fishermen, Mr. Secretary.

5994
06:01:17,960 --> 06:01:28,960
Rep. Romeo S. Momo Sr.: Our produce, the production, whatever derived or caught from fishing, are supplied.

5995
06:01:28,960 --> 06:01:36,680
Rep. Romeo S. Momo Sr.: Supplied to our neighboring municipalities, provinces, and cities. At dahil dito po, kami ang nagsusupply.

5996
06:01:38,120 --> 06:01:51,840
Rep. Romeo S. Momo Sr.: Right now, ito lang ho ang problema. Right now, although we are producing enough fish for reconsumption of our neighboring provinces and cities, wala ho kaming cold storage po.

5997
06:01:51,840 --> 06:01:58,120
Rep. Romeo S. Momo Sr.: Kaya yung aming mga fishermen ay mapilitan i-binta ng mura kung panahon na maraming kuha.

5998
06:01:58,960 --> 06:02:12,500
Rep. Romeo S. Momo Sr.: So sana po, I have been, in fact, a resolution has already submitted, a resolution from the Municipality of Liangga, where the proposed cold storage will be established.

5999
06:02:13,080 --> 06:02:17,520
Rep. Romeo S. Momo Sr.: E nandito na ho, nasabit na last year pa po. Sana mabigyan ng priority po ito.

6000
06:02:18,080 --> 06:02:21,300
DA Secretary Francisco P. Tiu Laurel Jr.: Yes, Mr. Chair. Saan exactong lugar, Mr. Chair?

6001
06:02:21,300 --> 06:02:27,540
Rep. Romeo S. Momo Sr.: Actually, Mr. Secretary, Barangay St. Christine, Liangga, Surigao del Sur.

6002
06:02:28,240 --> 06:02:28,300
Rep. Romeo S. Momo Sr.: Yes.

6003
06:02:28,960 --> 06:02:32,150
Rep. Romeo S. Momo Sr.: Yes. Liangga po.

6004
06:02:34,510 --> 06:02:39,470
DA Secretary Francisco P. Tiu Laurel Jr.: Yes, sir. Ang lagayin ho na ito, Mr. Chair, is ice plant and cold storage.

6005
06:02:39,990 --> 06:02:41,410
DA Secretary Francisco P. Tiu Laurel Jr.: Thank you very much, Mr. Secretary.

6006
06:02:41,410 --> 06:02:53,850
Rep. Romeo S. Momo Sr.: And the last, Mr. Chairman. In my district, this is addressed to NIA. In my district, I have two NIS, National Irrigation System.

6007
06:02:54,890 --> 06:03:01,510
Rep. Romeo S. Momo Sr.: And that suggests that we have thousands of irrigated farmlands.

6008
06:03:02,070 --> 06:03:05,190
Rep. Romeo S. Momo Sr.: Producing so much number of rice.

6009
06:03:06,230 --> 06:03:13,650
Rep. Romeo S. Momo Sr.: Kami ho ang nagsusupply ng mga, ng palay sa Gawaw, sa Cagayan de Uro, sa Marawi City.

6010
06:03:13,790 --> 06:03:15,250
Rep. Romeo S. Momo Sr.: Because of the two NIS.

6011
06:03:15,970 --> 06:03:22,010
Rep. Romeo S. Momo Sr.: My only problem now is, bakit ho dalawang NIS, 5 million lang ho ang allocation?

6012
06:03:23,390 --> 06:03:32,050
Rep. Romeo S. Momo Sr.: Dahil sa 5 million lang ang allocation, I would, parang nakikita ko ho na ang mga repair, maintenance, as well as upkeep.

6013
06:03:32,070 --> 06:03:35,150
Rep. Romeo S. Momo Sr.: Of the NIS is never enough.

6014
06:03:35,830 --> 06:03:37,390
Rep. Romeo S. Momo Sr.: And therefore, not enough, no?

6015
06:03:37,830 --> 06:03:44,130
Rep. Romeo S. Momo Sr.: And therefore, it will, of course, reduce the production of rice per hectare.

6016
06:03:44,250 --> 06:03:49,310
Rep. Romeo S. Momo Sr.: Kung hindi natin masusupplyan ng sufficient number of water, volume of water required.

6017
06:03:50,210 --> 06:03:56,250
Rep. Romeo S. Momo Sr.: Kaya nga ho, kailangan ho sana natin madagdagan ang ating requirements.

6018
06:03:57,070 --> 06:03:58,470
Rep. Romeo S. Momo Sr.: Dalawang NIS po, ha?

6019
06:03:58,470 --> 06:04:02,060
DA Secretary Francisco P. Tiu Laurel Jr.: Yes, Mr. Chair.

6020
06:04:03,320 --> 06:04:07,860
NIA Administrator Eduardo Eddie G. Guillen: Siguro nakita ni Honorable Congressman ito.

6021
06:04:08,200 --> 06:04:10,400
NIA Administrator Eduardo Eddie G. Guillen: Ang proposal namin sa isa, 2 billion eh.

6022
06:04:10,620 --> 06:04:13,360
NIA Administrator Eduardo Eddie G. Guillen: Talagang 2 billion pa ang proposal namin.

6023
06:04:13,900 --> 06:04:18,380
NIA Administrator Eduardo Eddie G. Guillen: Ang pet project po namin doon na isa is yung Tago Riz.

6024
06:04:18,600 --> 06:04:25,980
NIA Administrator Eduardo Eddie G. Guillen: Nag-propose po kami doon nga ng, at saka yung repair ng Santa Filomena CIS, 250 million.

6025
06:04:26,780 --> 06:04:29,720
NIA Administrator Eduardo Eddie G. Guillen: Pero tama po kayo, dalawang 5 million lang ang lumabas, sir.

6026
06:04:29,720 --> 06:04:33,260
NIA Administrator Eduardo Eddie G. Guillen: But again, isa po.

6027
06:04:33,320 --> 06:04:34,540
NIA Administrator Eduardo Eddie G. Guillen: Ito kasi sa priority natin.

6028
06:04:34,860 --> 06:04:37,580
NIA Administrator Eduardo Eddie G. Guillen: In fact, isa ito sa pinakamalaking hingin nga natin ang punto.

6029
06:04:38,060 --> 06:04:40,460
NIA Administrator Eduardo Eddie G. Guillen: Kung meron po tayong additional, sir, babalikan po namin ito.

6030
06:04:40,480 --> 06:04:46,900
Rep. Romeo S. Momo Sr.: Mr. Administrator, I have been here in Congress and I've been a vice chairman of the Committee on Appropriation for 8 years now.

6031
06:04:47,500 --> 06:04:52,380
Rep. Romeo S. Momo Sr.: And never in any instance I heard an agency na sobrang kanilang allocation.

6032
06:04:52,600 --> 06:04:53,380
Rep. Romeo S. Momo Sr.: Laging kulang po.

6033
06:04:54,080 --> 06:04:59,740
Rep. Romeo S. Momo Sr.: Ang question ko lang ho, how do you allocate that meager budget you have?

6034
06:05:00,240 --> 06:05:02,560
Rep. Romeo S. Momo Sr.: Kasi po, kailangan equitable ang distribution.

6035
06:05:02,720 --> 06:05:03,120
Rep. Romeo S. Momo Sr.: Not equal.

6036
06:05:03,120 --> 06:05:03,780
Rep. Romeo S. Momo Sr.: But equitable.

6037
06:05:04,580 --> 06:05:07,800
Rep. Romeo S. Momo Sr.: Mindanao po is i-breadbasket natin, di ba?

6038
06:05:08,520 --> 06:05:12,520
Rep. Romeo S. Momo Sr.: Dapat ho, may problema si Ropos, kulang.

6039
06:05:12,980 --> 06:05:15,320
Rep. Romeo S. Momo Sr.: Si Amatod, Congressman Amatong, kulang din.

6040
06:05:15,440 --> 06:05:17,700
Rep. Romeo S. Momo Sr.: Lahat-lahat kami yata, kulang buong Mindanao po.

6041
06:05:18,700 --> 06:05:22,920
Rep. Romeo S. Momo Sr.: Ang irony is, we are the ones supplying ng pagkain dito sa Metro Manila.

6042
06:05:23,580 --> 06:05:31,080
Rep. Romeo S. Momo Sr.: And why not put some bigger share even in the allocation of budget for irrigation?

6043
06:05:31,600 --> 06:05:32,360
NIA Administrator Eduardo Eddie G. Guillen: Yes, sir.

6044
06:05:32,460 --> 06:05:32,940
NIA Administrator Eduardo Eddie G. Guillen: Actually po.

6045
06:05:33,120 --> 06:05:33,720
NIA Administrator Eduardo Eddie G. Guillen: Ang NIA kasi.

6046
06:05:33,980 --> 06:05:39,680
NIA Administrator Eduardo Eddie G. Guillen: Again, ulitin ko po, Mr. Chair, ang na-priority po talaga na bigyan namin ng pondo are the ongoing projects.

6047
06:05:39,820 --> 06:05:45,180
NIA Administrator Eduardo Eddie G. Guillen: But kung mapapansin, bibigyan po ko po kaya ng listahan, Mr. Chair.

6048
06:05:45,580 --> 06:05:49,740
NIA Administrator Eduardo Eddie G. Guillen: Kapag kami mga savings po ang NIA, lagi namin nilalagay po lahat sa Mindanao.

6049
06:05:49,980 --> 06:05:54,300
NIA Administrator Eduardo Eddie G. Guillen: I will give you po a list, yung modification po namin this year, Mr. Chair.

6050
06:05:54,680 --> 06:05:58,700
NIA Administrator Eduardo Eddie G. Guillen: Makikita nyo po na pupunta halos lahat sa Mindanao yung aming budget.

6051
06:05:58,700 --> 06:06:00,160
Rep. Romeo S. Momo Sr.: And lastly, Mr. Chairman.

6052
06:06:00,740 --> 06:06:03,100
Rep. Romeo S. Momo Sr.: Lastly, sinabi ni Presidente nung panahon,

6053
06:06:03,120 --> 06:06:08,800
Rep. Romeo S. Momo Sr.: sa Suna, na ang tataposin nila, in fact, that is also the directive to the Department of Public Works and Highways,

6054
06:06:09,140 --> 06:06:12,080
Rep. Romeo S. Momo Sr.: tataposin nila yung mga ongoing projects.

6055
06:06:13,040 --> 06:06:19,420
Rep. Romeo S. Momo Sr.: In my district po, 60 milyon na lang ang kulang ng Santa Pilumina Dam.

6056
06:06:20,540 --> 06:06:21,900
Rep. Romeo S. Momo Sr.: Sana papangsyon na siya.

6057
06:06:22,660 --> 06:06:23,960
Rep. Romeo S. Momo Sr.: Sana po ang lagyan natin yan.

6058
06:06:24,400 --> 06:06:25,940
Rep. Romeo S. Momo Sr.: Kasi that's the priority of the President.

6059
06:06:26,760 --> 06:06:29,400
Rep. Romeo S. Momo Sr.: Yung tapusin yung mga proyekto ng nabimbin po.

6060
06:06:30,640 --> 06:06:31,520
NIA Administrator Eduardo Eddie G. Guillen: Yes, Mr. Chair.

6061
06:06:31,660 --> 06:06:32,940
NIA Administrator Eduardo Eddie G. Guillen: Iipa-priority natin po yan.

6062
06:06:33,120 --> 06:06:35,520
Rep. Romeo S. Momo Sr.: Thank you, thank you, Administrator.

6063
06:06:35,640 --> 06:06:36,120
Rep. Romeo S. Momo Sr.: Thank you, Secretary.

6064
06:06:36,980 --> 06:06:38,240
Rep. Romeo S. Momo Sr.: And thank you, Mr. Chairman.

6065
